{"availability":"available","full":"clowdhaus/ocync","name":"ocync","description":"Fast, concurrent OCI registry sync — copies container images between registries with zero wasted bandwidth","category":"Other","language":"Rust","stars":25,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-10T19:35:49Z","updated":"2026-10-08T20:38:58Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://clowdhaus.github.io/ocync/","topics":["aws","container-images","container-registry","docker","ecr","fips","image-sync","oci","oci-distribution","registry-sync","rust"],"demo":"https://clowdhaus.github.io/ocync/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.517Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.517Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.517Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.517Z","stars":25,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Sync OCI container images across registries - efficiently.","ocync copies container images between OCI registries with blob deduplication, cross-repo mounting, and streaming transfers. On real-world workloads it completes cold syncs 4x faster than comparable tools, with up to 30% fewer API requests, zero duplicate blob fetches across the run, and zero 429s on every benchmarked registry. See Performance for the full comparison.","ocync is purpose-built for one job: efficiently mirroring images from upstream registries (Docker Hub, GHCR, GAR, Chainguard) to a private registry (ECR, GAR, ACR). It is not a build tool, a registry, or a content rewriter - it copies bytes verbatim and lets the registry do its job. Multi-architecture indexes, manifests, blobs, and OCI 1.1 referrers (signatures, SBOMs, attestations) all flow through bit-for-bit."],"features":["Pure OCI Distribution API - no Docker daemon, no shelling out, direct HTTPS to registries","Additive sync only - never deletes; registries handle lifecycle and retention","Pipelined architecture - discovery and execution overlap; no idle time between phases","Global blob deduplication - shared layers across all images are transferred once per sync run","Cross-repo blob mounting - leader-follower election ensures shared layers mount instead of re-upload"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/clowdhaus/ocync/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0707fde885cc20fd22dc6bf270b63ccef4099ac6f4c2e559002cbcd736f8c724","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.767Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.767Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Sync OCI container images across registries - efficiently.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/clowdhaus/ocync/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"ocync is purpose-built for one job: efficiently mirroring images from upstream registries (Docker Hub, GHCR, GAR, Chainguard) to a private registry (ECR, GAR, ACR). It is not a build tool, a registry, or a content rewriter - it copies bytes verbatim and lets the registry do its job. Multi-architecture indexes, manifests, blobs, and OCI 1.1 referrers (signatures, SBOMs,…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/clowdhaus/ocync/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"0707fde885cc20fd22dc6bf270b63ccef4099ac6f4c2e559002cbcd736f8c724","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/clowdhaus/ocync/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.767Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T20:38:58Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/clowdhaus/ocync/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.768Z","hash":"0707fde885cc20fd22dc6bf270b63ccef4099ac6f4c2e559002cbcd736f8c724","originalBytes":7751,"storedBytes":7751,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["ocync","registry","docker","ecr","linux","source","sync","registries","yes","arm64","bash","blob","chainguard","config","oci","fips","helm","images","semver","across","build","bytes","container","install","latest","patterns","url","amd64","auth","clowdhaus","default","dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com","filtering","flow","gar","hub","in